o","golang","hacktoberfest","maven-server","npm-registry","vue"],"visibility":"public","forks":6255,"open_issues":2890,"watchers":52486,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/pulls/25799","html_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/25799","diff_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/25799.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/25799.patch","merged_at":"2023-07-10T11:51:05Z"},"body":"Backport #25648\r\n\r\nReplace #25580\r\n\r\nFix #19453\r\n\r\nThe problem was: when users set \"GITEA__XXX__YYY\" , the \"install page\" doesn't respect it.\r\n\r\nSo, to make the result consistent and avoid surprising end users, now the \"install page\" also writes the environment variables to the config file.\r\n\r\nAnd, to make things clear, there are enough messages on the UI to tell users what will happen.\r\n\r\nThere are some necessary/related changes to `environment-to-ini.go`:\r\n\r\n* The \"--clear\" flag is removed and it was incorrectly written there. The \"clear\" operation should be done if INSTALL_LOCK=true\r\n* The \"--prefix\" flag is removed because it's never used, never documented and it only causes inconsistent behavior.\r\n\r\nThe only conflict during backport is \"ui divider\" in templates/install.tmpl\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/25799/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/25799/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":9769716832,"node_id":"REFE_lADOBFIx285IKUJazwAAAAJGUgxg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/events/9769716832","actor":{"login":"sorenisanerd","id":160090,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDA5MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.gith